            "description": {
              "content": "<p>Retrieves information about the specified server certificate stored in IAM.</p> <p>For more information about working with server certificates, see <a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/IAM/latest/UserGuide/id_credentials_server-certs.html\">Working with server certificates</a> in the <i>IAM User Guide</i>. This topic includes a list of Amazon Web Services services that can use the server certificates that you manage with IAM.</p>",
              "type": "text/plain"
